# Awesome Tools & Not-for-Profit Organizations for Interns

## 🚀 Awesome Tools for Data, Policy, and Collaboration

### Data Science & Analysis
- **Jupyter Notebook** – Interactive Python coding, data analysis, and visualization.
- **pandas** – Powerful data manipulation library in Python.
- **NumPy** – Fast numerical computing.
- **matplotlib & seaborn** – For plotting and visualizing data.
- **OpenRefine** – For cleaning messy data.
- **Tableau Public** – Free dashboarding and data visualization platform.
- **Streamlit** – Python framework for building interactive dashboards.
- **QGIS** – Open-source GIS/mapping tool.
- **Google Colab** – Free cloud Jupyter notebooks with GPU/TPU support.

### Automation, Collaboration & Code
- **Git & GitHub** – Version control, collaboration, and code sharing.
- **Slack/Discord/Microsoft Teams** – For project communication.
- **Trello/Asana** – Project and task management.
- **Google Workspace (Docs, Sheets, Drive)** – Collaboration and document sharing.
- **Notion** – All-in-one workspace for notes, docs, and project management.

### Data Ethics & Security
- **Themis** – Data ethics assessment toolkit.
- **Mozilla Observatory** – Web security and privacy analysis.
- **OONI Probe** – Internet censorship measurement.

### Civic Tech & Open Data
- **Data.gov** – US government open datasets.
- **Kaggle Datasets** – Free data for analysis and learning.
- **OpenStreetMap** – Collaborative mapping project.

