## 🌟 Tips for Interns
- Look for “fellowship,” “internship,” or “volunteer” pages on nonprofit websites.
- Reach out directly to organizations with a brief intro and your skills/interests.
- Many organizations welcome remote/virtual interns, especially for data, analysis, and visualization roles.

